{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">放工後想吃得健康又不想太麻煩？蕭秀香（三姐）曾在 TVB 節目《三餸一湯》中示範一道風味獨特的「金瓜芋頭椰汁紅米飯」。利用電飯煲便可輕鬆煮出帶有濃郁椰香的豐富美味，紅米高纖健康，配上口感粉糯的南瓜與芋頭，最後淋上三姐的特製椰香醬汁，絕對是拌飯一流的靈魂菜式！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ecee70fb-c41c-4dc5-9974-97a0ac29b709.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20268kDDco3UCM1785492777.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ecee70fb-c41c-4dc5-9974-97a0ac29b709.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\">所需食材</h4><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">南瓜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">芋頭</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紅米</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">白米</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">椰汁</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">椰絲</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">花奶</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">調味料： 糖、鹽</p></li></ul><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\">烹調步驟</h4><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2a5a6880-2f03-4eda-b3f4-a5040a8ccc59.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/202607aPHFqCxL1785492785.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2a5a6880-2f03-4eda-b3f4-a5040a8ccc59.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\">三姐入廚小貼士</h4><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T01:23:59.956108+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}